This package consumes the SDS PR52 paid wrapper CLI
(`server/paid-useful-jobs/bin/cli.mjs`) as the current pinned
execute implementation. It does not copy that wrapper, the
useful-jobs engine archive, or the W4-commerce-14 Python
client (`tools/python-useful-jobs-client/`). Engine work stays
in the published archive the wrapper already extracts.

The independent runtime is `runtime/trial.py`. It only
subprocess-invokes the wrapper CLI with caller-owned files.
